<em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman this week reported that Apple plans to release <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/23/product-red-homepod-mini-airpods-max/">(PRODUCT)RED versions of the existing AirPods Max 2 and HomePod mini 2</a> on or around Tuesday, December 1, which is World AIDS Day. The new color will likely be the only change.<br/>
