<br/>
AirPods Max 2 <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/16/apple-announces-airpods-max-2/">launched in March for &#36;549</a>, while the HomePod mini 2 <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/13/apple-homepod-mini-2/">arrived last month for &#36;149</a>.<br/>
<br/>
